  "title": "Knee Arthroscopy and Meniscectomy",
  "jurisdiction": "Medicare Administrative Contractor (MAC) LCD",
  "effective_date": "2023-01-01",
  "category": "Orthopedic Surgery",
  "description": "Medicare coverage criteria for diagnostic and therapeutic knee arthroscopy, including partial meniscectomy and loose body removal. Requires mechanical locking/catching symptoms, MRI confirmation of unstable meniscal tear, and absence of advanced Kellgren-Lawrence Grade 4 tricompartmental osteoarthritis.",
